{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030710/extras/d22b22425e1ddbb6f8275a4b21e28f18.poster.avif?t=1771366775\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030710/extras/d22b22425e1ddbb6f8275a4b21e28f18.webm?t=1771366775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030710/extras/d22b22425e1ddbb6f8275a4b21e28f18.mp4?t=1771366775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your friend has vanished.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her last known location glows on your phone. You grab your keys, drive into the woods, and climb over a rusted fence with nothing but a flashlight and a lighter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the forest, scattered belongings and flickering bonfires pull you deeper. Each clue reveals fragments of her life and something far more terrifying than you imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Explore &amp; Survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tNavigate an abandoned woodland, or so it first seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tDiscover items and story fragments that reveal hidden connections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tPiece together what happened as the night grows darker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030710/extras/43fd5f42a44c7a36fb1f6eba1e198ad7.poster.avif?t=1771366775\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030710/extras/43fd5f42a44c7a36fb1f6eba1e198ad7.webm?t=1771366775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030710/extras/43fd5f42a44c7a36fb1f6eba1e198ad7.mp4?t=1771366775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030710/extras/1860616d6f8f15b7ad91e35b756f83d3.poster.avif?t=1771366775\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030710/extras/1860616d6f8f15b7ad91e35b756f83d3.webm?t=1771366775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030710/extras/1860616d6f8f15b7ad91e35b756f83d3.mp4?t=1771366775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26ea <strong>Face the Kult</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tUncover rituals and symbols of a sinister congregation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tEncounter unsettling figures and phenomena stalking your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tSurvive long enough to learn the truth or be consumed by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>A Short Retro Horror Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tInspired by PSX-style visuals and modern indie horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tFor fans of Puppet Combo, Chilla\u2019s Art, and Haunted PS1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\u2022\tA compact, atmospheric story you can complete in one sitting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you find your friend\u2026 or join The Kult?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030710?t=1771366775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/40307